@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = u100
@familyId = replace-with-created-relation-uuid

### 首次建档（完整字段）；已有档案执行此请求会覆盖这些字段
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/profile?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "王阿姨",
  "age": 68,
  "residence": "深圳",
  "language": "普通话",
  "walkSpeed": "MEDIUM",
  "walkDurationMin": 40,
  "avoidSteps": true,
  "interests": ["历史"],
  "interactionPreference": "VOICE",
  "emergencyContacts": [{"name":"王小明","phone":"138xxxx","relation":"儿子"}]
}

### 查询档案
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 部分更新
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/profile?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{"walkDurationMin":20,"avoidSteps":false}

### 创建待确认关系（复制响应 data.id 到顶部 familyId；不要反复执行）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/family-relations?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"王小明","relation":"儿子","phone":"138xxxx"}

### 查询家属关系
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/family-relations?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 老人确认绑定
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/family-relations/{{familyId}}/approve?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 修改授权（需先确认绑定）
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/family-relations/{{familyId}}/permissions?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{"shareLocation":true,"shareAlert":true}

### 撤回绑定（撤回后不可再次批准）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/family-relations/{{familyId}}/revoke?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
